menu "Prusa Remote Display OTA"

    config PRD_OTA_LAN_ORIGIN
        string "Private hardware-validation HTTPS origin"
        default ""
        help
            Exact https://PRIVATE_IPV4:PORT origin of the owner-operated local OTA fixture.
            Valid only in hardware-validation and only with the matching CA certificate path.
            Leave empty for the official GitHub release path.

    config PRD_OTA_LAN_CA_CERT_PATH
        string "Private hardware-validation CA PEM path"
        default ""
        help
            Absolute path to the public CA PEM that validates the local fixture server.
            Never point this at a private key. The certificate is embedded in the
            hardware-validation image; the private server key remains outside the repository.

endmenu
